        <activityName xml:lang="en">Oil storage 3000l</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Oil storage 3000l
Inventory for an oil storage with a life time of 20 years.;
UUID: 9944df7a-a060-3eec-afec-2ba4c5dd5d49
Infrastructure of an oil tank, including oil pipes and valves used for small oil heating. Disposal of the facilities. Not including energy use for the production.
Location: Data for Swiss producers.
Technology: Oil storage 3000l used for oil heating.
Time period: Materials investigated in 1993.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturers. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9944df7a-a060-3eec-afec-2ba4c5dd5d49.xml</text>
